# Eval-set scaffolding (brutal-review phase 1). The unlabeled JSONL is
# heavy (rollup + embeddings + raw events per session) and trivially
# regeneratable from the live corpus + seed, so it stays out of git.
# The rendered per-session markdown DOES ship — the labels in
# `eval/labels-v1.yaml` are anchored to the analyst-visible view, so
# pinning that view at HEAD is the audit trail for the eval set.
